              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Daudi ku yaabaire yaahika aha mutwe gw'ekibungo, yaarengaho kakye, yaabugana Ziiba omugaragwa wa Mefiboshesi, aine endogoya ibiri eziriho amatandiiko, zeekoreire emigaati magana abiri, n'emitsitsa igana y'emizaabibu eyomire, n'endiijo igana ey'ebijuma by'omu kyanda, n'efurebe ya viinyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugabe yaabuuza Ziiba ati: Ebi n'ebya ki? Ziiba yaamugarukamu ati: Endogoya n'ez'okuheeka ab'omu ka y'omugabe, emigaati n'ebijuma by'omu kyanda n'eby'okufugurira abatsigazi, kandi na viinyo n'ey'okunywebwa abaraagwere enshazi omu ihamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugabe yaagaruka yaamubuuza ati: Beitu shi, mutabani wa mukama waawe arahi? Ziiba yaamugarukamu ati: Reeba, atsigaire Yerusaalemu; ahakuba agizire ati: Eri izooba enju ya Israeli neija kungarura aha ngoma ya tata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugabe yaagira Ziiba ati: Reeba, ebibaire biri ebya Mefiboshesi byona, hati n'ebyawe. Ziiba yaagira ati: Kasingye, Nyakusinga omugabe. Ngume ngirirwe ntyo embabazi omu maisho gaawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
