        },
        {
          "text": " Omugabe Daudi ku yaahikire haihi na Bahurimu, haarugayo omushaija ow'omu muryango gw'enju ya Saulo orikwetwa Shimei mwene Geera; yaija naamukyeena; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaarekyera Daudi n'abagaragwa be boona amabaare; abantu boona n'abashaija be amamanzi bakaba bamushagatiire aha rubaju rwa buryo n'orwa bumosho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shimei ku yaabaire naamukyeena, yaaguma naagira ati: Rugaho, rugaho, iwe mwitani 'we, ekishaija kitaine mugasho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.1.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 1:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA akutuzire eshagama y'enju ya Saulo yoona, ou waahunguriire, okaza aha ngoma ye; mbwenu MUKAMA ahaire Abusalomu mutabani waawe obugabe bwawe; reeba, otuzirwe eitima ryawe, ahakuba ori omwitani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
