              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahisofeeli yaagira Abusalomu ati: Irooko obyame n'ebinyanshunju bya sho, ebi atsigiire eka ye kugirinda; haza Abaisraeli boona nibaija kumanyira aho ku otamirwe sho; n'ahabw'ekyo abu oine boona nibaija kuhama. ",
          "type": "text",
