        {
          "text": " Batyo baateerera Abusalomu eihema aha mutwe gw'enju; Abusalomu yaaritaahamu, yaabyama n'ebinyanshunju bya ishe, Abaisraeli boona nibakireeba. ",
          "type": "text",
