          "text": " Kandi omu biro ebyo obwengye obu Ahisofeeli yaabaire aha, bukaba buba nk'obu omuntu ahairwe Ruhanga; okwo nikwo obwengye bwa Ahisofeeli bwabaire busiimwa Daudi, kandi na Abusalomu.",
